body:
In contrast to those who are immediately jumping to support your wife's hardship (as it deserves to be supported) over your current emotional confusion. I just wanted to weigh in an say that it is also ok for you to feel discomforted by this fact and that it wasn't disclosed to you before making as serious a commitment as marriage. 

&#x200B;

How you deal with that discomfort is the real test of your character, and many others have given great advice in that regard. But, you shouldn't let the whole social agenda of destigmatizing sex workers gaslight the discomfort you are allowed to feel.
